</div><div class="loc article-left-rail"><div id="sticky-toc-wrapper_1-0" class="comp sticky-toc-wrapper mntl-block js-sticky-container"></div>
</div><div class="loc article-content">
<div id="health-sc-page_1-0" class="comp health-sc-page mntl-sc-page mntl-block structured-content article-content expert-content right-rail__offset lock-journey" data-sc-sticky-offset="60" data-sc-ad-label-height="24" data-sc-ad-track-spacing="100" data-sc-min-track-height="250" data-sc-max-track-height="600" data-sc-breakpoint="50em" data-sc-load-immediate="4" data-sc-content-positions="[400, 1400, 1400, 1700, 2000, 2200, 2400, 2600, 2800]" data-bind-scroll-on-start="true"><div id="health-sc-block-callout--key-takeaway_1-0" class="comp health-sc-block-callout--key-takeaway health-sc-block-callout-base mntl-sc-block-callout mntl-block theme-key-takeaway theme-key-takeaway" data-tracking-id="mntl-sc-block-callout" data-tracking-container="true"><h3 id="mntl-sc-block-callout-heading_1-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block-callout-heading mntl-text-block">Key Takeaways</h3>
<div id="mntl-sc-block-callout-body_1-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block-callout-body mntl-text-block expert-content"><ul><li>Call 911 immediately if you suspect a head injury.</li><li>Do not move someone with a head injury unless they are in immediate danger because it could make things worse.</li><li>Signs of a brain injury can appear right away or take time to show up, so keep watch for changes in cognition, sensory symptoms, and difficulty with physical function.</li></ul></div></div>
<p id="mntl-sc-block_2-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-html"> Head trauma can lead to serious complications, so recognizing the signs and symptoms early is crucial. If you suspect someone has a head, neck, or spine injury after an accident, call 911 immediately. Do not move them, unless they are in immediate danger of further injury, because you could make their injuries much worse.
</p>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_3-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block mntl-sc-block-adslot mntl-block"></div>
<figure id="health-sc-block-image--none_1-0" class="comp health-sc-block-image--none health-sc-block-image-base mntl-sc-block-image mntl-sc-block-image--no-theme no-theme mntl-sc-block theme-none figure-landscape figure-high-res"> <div class="figure-media">
<div class="img-placeholder" style="padding-bottom:66.6%;">
